  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Online Bureau\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 27, 2026 at 06:46 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>At the ETHealthworld Nutriwell Conclave 2026, the panel discussion, “GLP-1s: Are They Creating a Health Crisis or Creating a New Market?” explored the therapeutic benefits, <a href=\"/tag/potential+risks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">potential risks</a> and growing concerns surrounding the indiscriminate use of GLP-1 medications.Dr. Rajesh Rajput, Director &amp; Head, Division of Endocrinology &amp; Diabetes, Medanta, Gurugram, highlighted the benefits of <a href=\"/tag/glp-1+therapies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GLP-1 therapies</a> in <a href=\"/tag/weight+management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">weight management</a>, glycaemic control and metabolic health. He emphasised <a href=\"/tag/appropriate+patient+screening\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">appropriate patient screening</a>, <a href=\"/tag/medical+supervision\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">medical supervision</a> and long-term weight maintenance strategies while cautioning against unauthorised prescriptions and cosmetic use.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Dr. Rohit Warrier, Communications Director, American Diabetes Association, stressed the importance of distinguishing statistical associations from established causality when evaluating potential side effects. He advocated evidence-based prescribing and careful patient selection.Dr. Anuj Maheshwari, President, RSSDI, highlighted the need for India-specific clinical research, considering differences in nutritional patterns and metabolic profiles. He expressed concerns about muscle loss, nutritional deficiencies and weight regain following treatment discontinuation.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Dr. Anil Arora, Senior Consultant, Institute of Liver Gastroenterology &amp; Pancreatico Biliary Sciences, discussed the potential of GLP-1 therapies in managing fatty liver disease and interconnected metabolic disorders. He emphasised that pharmacological interventions must be complemented by regular exercise and sustainable lifestyle modifications.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Moderated by Vikas Dandekar, Editor, Pharma &amp; Healthcare, Economic Times Group, the discussion reinforced that GLP-1 therapies offer significant clinical opportunities, but their indiscriminate use, commercialisation and lack of medical supervision could create serious health challenges.Key takeaways:</p><ul><li>Ensure responsible prescribing and appropriate patient screening.</li><li>Strengthen India-specific clinical research and real-world evidence.</li><li>Prioritise nutritional adequacy and muscle preservation.</li><li>Discourage cosmetic and unsupervised use of GLP-1 medications.</li><li>Combine pharmacological interventions with sustainable lifestyle modifications.</li></ul>                    <!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                                                                <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                    </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Nov 27, 2026 at 06:46 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Nov 27, 2026 at 06:46 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry ri